{"seq":3,"slug":"first-contribution","title":"第一次贡献","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/getting-started/first-contribution","wordCount":853,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"第一次贡献\">第一次贡献</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>第一次贡献的关键，是把&quot;想帮忙&quot;转化为一次可被合并的、边界清晰的改动。开源协作建立在几个稳定的概念之上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Contribution</td>\n<td>一切有价值的产出，包括代码、文档、翻译、Bug 报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good first issue</td>\n<td>维护者标记的适合新手、边界清晰的任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fork</td>\n<td>将上游仓库复制到自己名下，作为提交改动的起点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pull Request (PR)</td>\n<td>请求上游合并你的改动，是贡献的最终交付物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conventional Commits</td>\n<td>提交信息规范，用 feat/fix/docs 等前缀表达意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Code Review</td>\n<td>维护者对改动提出反馈的协作环节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要贡献开源\">为什么要贡献开源</h2><p>参与开源贡献是提升技术能力、积累行业声誉和拓展职业机会的高效方式。许多知名开发者的职业生涯都始于一次开源贡献。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>贡献收益</th>\n<th>具体说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技术成长</td>\n<td>阅读优秀代码，学习工程实践，获得资深开发者 Code Review</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>职业机会</td>\n<td>开源贡献记录是简历的有力补充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区影响力</td>\n<td>建立技术声誉，结识志同道合的开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解决实际问题</td>\n<td>直接改进自己日常使用的工具和库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    USE[使用开源项目] --&gt; FIND[发现问题/需求]&#10;    FIND --&gt; FIX[提交修复/改进]&#10;    FIX --&gt; REVIEW[接受 Code Review]&#10;    REVIEW --&gt; MERGE[PR 被合并]&#10;    MERGE --&gt; GROW[技术成长]&#10;    GROW --&gt; USE\">graph LR\n    USE[使用开源项目] --&gt; FIND[发现问题/需求]\n    FIND --&gt; FIX[提交修复/改进]\n    FIX --&gt; REVIEW[接受 Code Review]\n    REVIEW --&gt; MERGE[PR 被合并]\n    MERGE --&gt; GROW[技术成长]\n    GROW --&gt; USE</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 开源贡献不仅限于代码。文档改进、Bug 报告、问题解答、翻译和设计都是有价值的贡献形式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"发现适合的项目\">发现适合的项目</h2><p>找到适合自己的第一个项目是成功贡献的关键。以下策略可以帮助你高效筛选：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gh search repos --topic=good-first-issues --language=typescript --sort=stars --limit=10&#10;&#10;gh search issues --label=&quot;good first issue&quot; --language=typescript --sort=created --limit=10&#10;&#10;gh search issues --label=&quot;help wanted&quot; --repo=facebook/react --sort=updated --limit=5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> search</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repos</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --topic=good-first-issues</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --language=typescript</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sort=stars</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --limit=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> search</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> issues</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --label=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"good first issue\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --language=typescript</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sort=created</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --limit=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> search</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> issues</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --label=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"help wanted\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --repo=facebook/react</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sort=updated</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --limit=5</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标签</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适合人群</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>good first issue</td>\n<td>入门级任务</td>\n<td>首次贡献者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>help wanted</td>\n<td>需要社区帮助</td>\n<td>有一定经验的人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>documentation</td>\n<td>文档相关任务</td>\n<td>技术写作爱好者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bug</td>\n<td>已确认的缺陷</td>\n<td>喜欢排错的人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>enhancement</td>\n<td>功能改进建议</td>\n<td>有想法的开发者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择项目的检查清单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"- [ ] 项目有明确的 CONTRIBUTING.md&#10;- [ ] 最近 30 天有活跃的提交记录&#10;- [ ] Issue 和 PR 有维护者的及时回复&#10;- [ ] 有清晰的开发环境搭建文档&#10;- [ ] 社区氛围友好（查看 Issue 讨论风格）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 项目有明确的 CONTRIBUTING.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 最近 30 天有活跃的提交记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] Issue 和 PR 有维护者的及时回复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 有清晰的开发环境搭建文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 社区氛围友好（查看 Issue 讨论风格）</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"fork-与开发环境搭建\">Fork 与开发环境搭建</h2><p>找到目标项目和 Issue 后，按照标准流程 Fork 仓库并搭建本地开发环境。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gh repo fork facebook/react --clone&#10;&#10;cd react&#10;&#10;git remote -v&#10;&#10;git checkout -b fix/typo-in-readme&#10;&#10;cat CONTRIBUTING.md | head -50&#10;&#10;npm install&#10;&#10;npm test\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fork</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> facebook/react</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --clone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> react</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix/typo-in-readme</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CONTRIBUTING.md</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 你的 Fork&#10;    participant O as 上游仓库&#10;    participant L as 本地仓库&#10;&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;U: Fork&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;L: Clone&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;L: 创建特性分支&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;L: 开发 &amp; 测试&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;U: Push&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;O: 创建 Pull Request&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;O: Code Review&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;O: Merge\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 你的 Fork\n    participant O as 上游仓库\n    participant L as 本地仓库\n\n    O-&gt;&gt;U: Fork\n    U-&gt;&gt;L: Clone\n    L-&gt;&gt;L: 创建特性分支\n    L-&gt;&gt;L: 开发 &amp; 测试\n    L-&gt;&gt;U: Push\n    U-&gt;&gt;O: 创建 Pull Request\n    O-&gt;&gt;O: Code Review\n    O-&gt;&gt;O: Merge</pre><p>保持与上游仓库同步：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git remote add upstream https://github.com/facebook/react.git&#10;&#10;git fetch upstream&#10;&#10;git rebase upstream/main&#10;&#10;git push origin fix/typo-in-readme\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/facebook/react.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream/main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix/typo-in-readme</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在开始编码之前，先在 Issue 下留言表明你打算解决这个问题。这可以避免重复劳动，也让维护者知道有人在处理。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"编写规范的提交\">编写规范的提交</h2><p>高质量的提交信息（Commit Message）是开源协作的基本素养。大多数项目遵循 Conventional Commits 规范。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git commit -m &quot;fix: correct typo in README installation section&quot;&#10;&#10;git commit -m &quot;feat: add dark mode support for dashboard&quot;&#10;&#10;git commit -m &quot;docs: update API reference for v2.0 endpoints&quot;&#10;&#10;git commit -m &quot;fix(parser): handle edge case in nested object parsing&#10;&#10;Closes #1234&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"fix: correct typo in README installation section\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: add dark mode support for dashboard\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"docs: update API reference for v2.0 endpoints\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"fix(parser): handle edge case in nested object parsing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Closes #1234\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>feat</td>\n<td>新功能</td>\n<td>feat: add user avatar upload</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fix</td>\n<td>Bug 修复</td>\n<td>fix: resolve memory leak</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docs</td>\n<td>文档更新</td>\n<td>docs: add migration guide</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>style</td>\n<td>格式调整</td>\n<td>style: format with prettier</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>refactor</td>\n<td>重构</td>\n<td>refactor: extract auth module</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>test</td>\n<td>测试相关</td>\n<td>test: add unit tests for utils</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>chore</td>\n<td>构建/工具变更</td>\n<td>chore: update dependencies</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"提交-pull-request\">提交 Pull Request</h2><p>PR 是开源贡献的最终交付物。一个好的 PR 应该清晰描述变更内容、动机和测试情况。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 变更描述&#10;&#10;修复了 README 中安装步骤的错误命令。原命令 `npm install -g mylib@latest` 缺少 `--save` 标志，导致新用户按照文档操作时遇到依赖未保存的问题。&#10;&#10;## 关联 Issue&#10;&#10;Closes #1234&#10;&#10;## 变更类型&#10;&#10;- [x] Bug 修复&#10;- [ ] 新功能&#10;- [ ] 文档更新&#10;- [ ] 重构&#10;&#10;## 测试&#10;&#10;- [x] 本地验证安装命令可正常执行&#10;- [x] 通过现有测试套件\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 变更描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">修复了 README 中安装步骤的错误命令。原命令 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`npm install -g mylib@latest`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 缺少 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`--save`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 标志，导致新用户按照文档操作时遇到依赖未保存的问题。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 关联 Issue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Closes #1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 变更类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] Bug 修复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 新功能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 文档更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 重构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] 本地验证安装命令可正常执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] 通过现有测试套件</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gh pr create \\&#10;  --title &quot;fix: correct install command in README&quot; \\&#10;  --body-file pr-description.md \\&#10;  --base main \\&#10;  --head fix/typo-in-readme\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --title</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"fix: correct install command in README\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --body-file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pr-description.md</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --base</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --head</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix/typo-in-readme</span></span></code></pre></div><p>收到 Code Review 反馈后的处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git add .&#10;git commit -m &quot;fix: address review feedback - use npm ci instead&quot;&#10;git push origin fix/typo-in-readme\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"fix: address review feedback - use npm ci instead\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix/typo-in-readme</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((第一次贡献))&#10;    准备&#10;      寻找项目&#10;      good first issue&#10;      阅读 CONTRIBUTING.md&#10;    流程&#10;      Fork 仓库&#10;      搭建开发环境&#10;      创建特性分支&#10;    规范&#10;      Conventional Commits&#10;      PR 模板&#10;      Code Review&#10;    技巧&#10;      先在 Issue 留言&#10;      保持分支同步&#10;      小步提交\">mindmap\n  root((第一次贡献))\n    准备\n      寻找项目\n      good first issue\n      阅读 CONTRIBUTING.md\n    流程\n      Fork 仓库\n      搭建开发环境\n      创建特性分支\n    规范\n      Conventional Commits\n      PR 模板\n      Code Review\n    技巧\n      先在 Issue 留言\n      保持分支同步\n      小步提交</pre><ul>\n<li>开源贡献不仅限于代码，文档、Bug 报告、翻译都是有价值的贡献形式。</li>\n<li>通过 <code>good first issue</code> 和 <code>help wanted</code> 标签可以快速找到适合新手的任务。</li>\n<li>Fork → 分支 → 开发 → Push → PR 是标准的贡献工作流。</li>\n<li>Conventional Commits 规范使提交信息清晰可读，便于自动化工具处理。</li>\n<li>PR 应清晰描述变更动机、关联 Issue、测试情况，并积极响应 Code Review 反馈。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"第一次贡献","id":"第一次贡献"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要贡献开源","id":"为什么要贡献开源"},{"level":2,"text":"发现适合的项目","id":"发现适合的项目"},{"level":2,"text":"Fork 与开发环境搭建","id":"fork-与开发环境搭建"},{"level":2,"text":"编写规范的提交","id":"编写规范的提交"},{"level":2,"text":"提交 Pull Request","id":"提交-pull-request"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"选择开源许可证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/getting-started/choosing-a-license"},"next":{"title":"社区礼仪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/getting-started/community-etiquette"}}